OL,3,GNEWSAAnimals struggling amid drought,
OL,4,Acharity warns
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn animal charity in Leicestershire has
OL,7,Ftold of the severe impact on local
OL,8,Fwildlife due to the prolonged hot and
OL,9,Fdry weather.
OL,11,FLeicestershire Wildlife Hospital, based
OL,12,Fin Kibworth Beauchamp near Market
OL,13,FHarborough, said it was taking in more
OL,14,Fcreatures than ever that were
OL,15,Fdehydrated or starving due to the
OL,16,Fconditions.
OL,18,FAmy Ducker, from the charity, told the
OL,19,FBBC it had already exhausted its water
OL,20,Freserves, which usually last an entire
OL,21,Fsummer.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,366,360,200,160,0,100
